	skos:prefLabel "Tibetan Delegation to the United Nations"@en ;
	gist:description """<p>
	Tibetan government officials Rinchen Sadutshang, Tsipon Wangchuk Deden Shakabpa and Gyalo Thondup, the Dalai Lama's older brother in front of the United Nations in September 1959. The delegation made three such trips to the UN, in the falls of 1959, 1960 and 1961, to seek support for Tibet. &nbsp;</p>
<p>
	&nbsp;</p>"""@en ;
	gist:isCategorizedBy tolx:_WorkType_photograph ;
